// AWS IAM Login Profile Updated (Password Reset)  [tier: alert]  ATT&CK: T1098
// Detects modification of an IAM user's console password (UpdateLoginProfile). Attackers reset passwords to hijack accounts; high-signal when…
// False positives: Help-desk password resets and self-service password changes.
// Source: rules/persistence/iam-update-login-profile.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
from * metadata _id, _index, _version | where eventName=="UpdateLoginProfile" and eventSource=="iam.amazonaws.com"
